# Local browser and automation profiles contain cookies, login databases,
# session storage, extension state, history, and machine-specific caches.
.sk/
**/Default/Cookies*
**/Default/Login Data*
**/Default/Session Storage/
**/Default/Local Storage/
**/Default/Extension State/
**/Default/Preferences
**/Local State

# Local credentials and runtime state never belong in this profile repository.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
